IMF.STA:MFS_NSRF(1.0.3),ZAF,ODCS,NSRF_22D,XDC,M,1971-M06,6788150000,6,,,,,,,O,,true,,,"The Monetary and Financial Statistics–Nonstandard dataset contains country-reported information on financial sectors—including central banks, banks, and non-bank institutions—that is not harmonized across countries and uses country-specific terminology. This dataset includes only vintage data and has been discontinued as of [insert date]. For access to standardized and harmonized data, please refer to the MFS-Central Bank and MFS-Depository Corporations datasets, among others.",,IMF,STA,datahelp@imf.org,,"G00,IFS",,MFS;Broad Money;Monetary Base;Net Foreign Assets;Monetary Statistics;Financial Statistics;Central Bank Statistics;Financial statistics;Monetary policy;Financial institutions;Financial instruments;Financial markets,EN,2026-10-18T03:48:55.049479600Z,2026-10-18T03:48:55.088343100Z,,Monetary and Financial Statistics Manual and Compilation Guide 2016.,PUBLIC_OPEN,,PUB,,Country authorities; National Summary Data Pages; European Central Bank; IMF Staff Calculations,,© International Monetary Fund Copyright. All Rights Reserved. https://www.imf.org/external/terms.htm,International Monetary Fund. 2025. Monetary and Financial Statistics (MFS): Central Bank Data  https://data.imf.org/en/datasets//IMF.STA:MFS_NSRF. Accessed on [current date].,,
